Dashboard iceye_pl_statement {
  title: 'P&L Statement'
  description: 'ICEYE P&L with account-group totals and calculated subtotals (Gross Margin, EBITDA, Net Profit), built two ways: Pivot + mapping model, and Metric Sheet with pure AQL metrics. Both reconcile to the cent.'
  owner: 'chukwudi@holistics.io'
  block t5_title: TextBlock {
    content: @md <h1 style="font-size:26px; font-weight:600; color:#ffffff; margin:0; padding:0 24px; display:flex; align-items:center; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; background:linear-gradient(97deg, #051527 15%, #123c4a 85%); border-radius:8px;">P&L Statement — Gross Margin, EBITDA & Net Profit</h1>;;
  }
  block t5_date_filter: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Posting Period'
    type: 'date'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      field: ref('iceye_fact_pl_statements', 'resolved_posting_date')
    }
    default {
      operator: 'matches'
      value: 'last 3 years'
    }
  }
  block t5_dept_filter: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Department'
    type: 'field'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      field: ref('iceye_dim_departments', 'department_name')
    }
    default {
      operator: 'is'
      value: []
    }
  }
  block t5_kpi_revenue: VizBlock {
    label: 'Revenue'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      value: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Revenue'
        ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_revenue)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: '[€]#,###0'
        }
      }
      settings {
        display_mode: 'single'
        alignment: 'left'
        metric_value {
          font_size: 28
        }
      }
    }
    settings {
      hide_label: true
    }
    theme: holistics_kpi_blue_dark
  }
  block t5_kpi_gm: VizBlock {
    label: 'Gross Margin %'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      value: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Gross Margin %'
        ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_gross_margin_pct)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: '#,###0.0%'
        }
      }
      settings {
        display_mode: 'single'
        alignment: 'left'
        metric_value {
          font_size: 28
        }
      }
    }
    settings {
      hide_label: true
    }
    theme: holistics_kpi_blue_dark
  }
  block t5_kpi_ebitda: VizBlock {
    label: 'EBITDA Margin %'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      value: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'EBITDA Margin %'
        ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_ebitda_margin_pct)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: '#,###0.0%'
        }
      }
      settings {
        display_mode: 'single'
        alignment: 'left'
        metric_value {
          font_size: 28
        }
      }
    }
    settings {
      hide_label: true
    }
    theme: holistics_kpi_blue_dark
  }
  block t5_kpi_net: VizBlock {
    label: 'Net Profit'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      value: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Net Profit'
        ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_net_profit)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: '[€]#,###0'
        }
      }
      settings {
        display_mode: 'single'
        alignment: 'left'
        metric_value {
          font_size: 28
        }
      }
    }
    settings {
      hide_label: true
    }
    theme: holistics_kpi_blue_dark
  }
  block t5_statement: VizBlock {
    label: 'Profit & Loss Statement (EUR)'
    description: 'Section totals (A, B, C, D, F) and calculated subtotals (A-B Gross Margin, A-B-C EBITDA, A-B-C-D-F Net Profit) in one table, driven by the P&L Report Lines mapping. F (Financial Expenses) is mapped but has no accounts in this demo ledger, so it contributes zero and shows no row.'
    viz: PivotTable {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      theme {
        table {
          general {
            bg_color: '#FFFFFF'
            hover_color: '#F3F6F8'
            banding_color: '#FFFFFF'
            font_size: 13
            font_color: '#1F2A37'
            border_color: '#D5DEE5'
            border_width: 1
            grid_color: '#EDF1F4'
          }
          header {
            bg_color: '#0B2233'
            font_size: 13
            font_weight: 'semibold'
            font_color: '#FFFFFF'
          }
          sub_header {
            bg_color: '#123C4A'
            font_size: 12
            font_weight: 'medium'
            font_color: '#CFE0E8'
          }
        }
      }
      rows: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(iceye_pl_report_lines.line_order)
          uname: 'pl_line_order'
          hidden: true
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Code'
          ref: r(iceye_pl_report_lines.line_code)
          uname: 'pl_line_code'
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'P&L Line'
          ref: r(iceye_pl_report_lines.line_label)
          uname: 'iceye_pl_report_lines_line_label'
        }
      ]
      columns: [
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Fiscal Year'
          ref: r(iceye_fact_pl_statements.resolved_posting_date)
          transformation: 'datetrunc year'
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: "'FY' yyyy"
          }
        }
      ]
      values: [
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Amount'
          ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.total_net_amount_eur)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: '[€]#,###0'
          }
          uname: 'pl_net_eur'
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: '% Rev'
          ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_pct_of_revenue)
          format {
            type: 'number'
            pattern: '#,###0.0%'
          }
          uname: 'pl_pct_rev'
        }
      ]
      settings {
        show_row_total: true
        conditional_formats: [
          ConditionalFormat {
            key: 'pl_net_eur'
            format: SingleFormat {
              condition {
                operator: 'less_than'
                value: 0
              }
              text_color: '#B42318'
              background_color: '#00000000'
            }
          }
        ]
        sorts: [
          SortSetting {
            key: 'pl_line_order'
            direction: 'asc'
          }
        ]
        row_limit: 5000
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
        frozen_columns: 3
        column_styles: [
          ColumnStyle {
            key: 'pl_line_code'
            width: 80
          },
          ColumnStyle {
            key: 'iceye_pl_report_lines_line_label'
            width: 250
          },
          ColumnStyle {
            key: 'pl_net_eur'
            width: 140
          },
          ColumnStyle {
            key: 'pl_pct_rev'
            width: 82
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
  block t5_margin_trend: VizBlock {
    label: 'Margin Profile by Quarter'
    viz: LineChart {
      dataset: profit_loss_statement_dataset
      x_axis: VizFieldFull {
        ref: r(iceye_fact_pl_statements.resolved_posting_date)
        transformation: 'datetrunc quarter'
        format {
          type: 'date'
          pattern: "yyyy 'Q'q"
        }
      }
      y_axis {
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            label: 'Gross Margin %'
            ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_gross_margin_pct)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: '#,###0.0%'
            }
          }
        }
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            label: 'EBITDA Margin %'
            ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_ebitda_margin_pct)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: '#,###0.0%'
            }
          }
        }
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            label: 'Net Margin %'
            ref: r(profit_loss_statement_dataset.pl_net_margin_pct)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: '#,###0.0%'
            }
          }
        }
      }
      settings {
        row_limit: 5000
        x_axis_show_null_datetime: false
      }
    }
  }
  block t5_howto: TextBlock {
    content: @md
### How the subtotals work

Every account maps to **each line it rolls into** in one small mapping model (`iceye_pl_report_lines`):

| Code | Line | Accounts included |
|---|---|---|
| A, B, C, D, F | Section totals | accounts in that section |
| A1, B2 … | Account detail | that account |
| **A-B** | **Gross Margin** | Revenue + COGS |
| **A-B-C** | **EBITDA** | + OPEX |
| F | Financial Expenses | none in this demo ledger |
| **A-B-C-D-F** | **Net Profit** | + D&A + Financial |

Amounts are signed (credit − debit), so one `sum` per line gives both the group totals and the calculated subtotals, in order, in one pivot. Filters, periods and drill-downs still work, and a new line (e.g. EBIT, or F Financial Expenses once those accounts exist) is one more row in the mapping.

*F is mapped but empty: this demo ledger has no financial-expense accounts, so no F row appears and F adds zero to Net Profit.*
;;
  }
